-  "shipped_budget_grid_spans_the_safe_firing_window": "The grid-adequacy guard. A 'no safe value' answer from a grid that contains no point strictly between the largest at-risk gap and the largest post-level-up tail is a GRID ARTIFACT, not a property of the mechanism. This is why grace 350 was run.",
